  "description": "Lucian is a royal princess by day and the infamous \"Phantom Princess\" by night. To ruin her upcoming arranged marriage to Prince Heveron, she sneaks into his chambers to rob him blind and vanish. Too bad her fiancé just took a very strange potion. Waking up in a horny haze, Heveron mistakes Lucian’s midnight robbery for a lucid dream and decides to play along, starting with a scorching kiss. Now, the clumsy thief is trapped under her muscular fiancé, wondering if she'll manage to steal his treasure or if he’s going to steal her heart instead.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Sunaemul Danpyeonseon (순애물 단편선) Collection.*",
